            "answer": {
              "short": "20 days.",
              "worked": "Add the frequencies of the five classes from $24.3$–$24.5^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ through $25.5$–$25.7^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$:\n$$6+4+4+3+3=20$$\nThere were 20 days.",
